  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgroInvest is a rural microcredit programme started by WV Montenegro in July 1999. Sida will support AI with additional loan capital. The loan capital will be used in the Podgorica branch office to make loans in surrounding villages. Supporting the development of rural businesses and improved rural economy through micro credit services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AgroInvest mikrokreditprogram startades av WV Montenegro i juli 1999. Sida ska st&#xF6;dja AI med extra l&#xE5;nkapital. Detta kapital kommer att anv&#xE4;ndas i Podgorica kontoret f&#xF6;r att ge l&#xE5;n till omkringliggande byar. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att st&#xF6;dja utveckling av f&#xF6;retagande p&#xE5; landsbygden och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad ekonomi i rurala omr&#xE5;den genom mikrokreditutl&#xE5;ning.</narrative>
  </description>
